A01: bind OSDK installation to a private source-specific root

Keep each kernel build's cargo-osdk executable and source-root receipt in a guarded private installation. Validate private path ingress before recursive make so a tool compiled for another absolute checkout cannot silently build different source.

Validation: kernel runner 40 tests in ordinary and isolated Python, supervisor 9, repro 32; independent ingress/make and real Cargo path-form checks. This change has host validation; fresh complete kernel build and QEMU boot are recorded separately.